{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SRN37TKemHPxPnaAfHGuod","type":"tool_result","content":"=== ch13 closing: somebody has to install that ===\n1279:You have met this exact shape before. The book told you to remember it by name, and Chapter 10 built a section on it: **the object exists; nothing happens without the component.** An Ingress object on a cluster with no Ingress controller is accepted by the API server, stored in etcd, retrievable with `kubectl get`, and completely inert. The API is the contract. The controller is the implementation. Kubernetes ships the contract; somebody has to install the implementation.\n1830:Before that, though, there is a different kind of question waiting. This chapter kept saying \"somebody has to install that\": metrics-server, a logging backend, an Ingress controller. The next chapters are about how anything gets installed on a cluster at all, and about the moment a folder full of YAML stops being a workable answer.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9534cc4f-be85-4d73-8a35-cd0d846700e5","uuid":"94b3068f-e149-40cf-b4d4-70b34b840337","timestamp":"2026-08-31T09:37:45.441Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"=== ch13 closing: somebody has to install that ===\n1279:You have met this exact shape before. The book told you to remember it by name, and Chapter 10 built a section on it: **the object exists; nothing happens without the component.** An Ingress object on a cluster with no Ingress controller is accepted by the API server, stored in etcd, retrievable with `kubectl get`, and completely inert. The API is the contract. The controller is the implementation. Kubernetes ships the contract; somebody has to install the implementation.\n1830:Before that, though, there is a different kind of question waiting. This chapter kept saying \"somebody has to install that\": metrics-server, a logging backend, an Ingress controller. The next chapters are about how anything gets installed on a cluster at all, and about the moment a folder full of YAML stops being a workable answer.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
